flowchart TB
    Internet[Public evaluator network] --> TLS[TLS and reverse proxy]
    TLS --> API1[FastAPI container pinned by digest]
    API1 --> HCX[HyperCLOVA X endpoint]
    API1 --> Data[(Read-only Parquet and DuckDB)]
    API1 --> Policy[Read-only registry, schemas, prompts]
    API1 --> Health[Health and metrics without query text]
    Manifest[Release manifest] --> API1
    Source[Organizer ZIP hash gate] --> Build[Pre-freeze ETL and image build]
    Build --> Data
    Build --> API1
    Secret[Runtime secret store] --> API1
